          "unit": "A",
          "explanation": "$i(T) = i(0) + \\frac{1}{L}\\int_0^T v\\,dt = I_0 + \\frac{VT}{L}$ = {{I0|A}} + ({{V|V}} × {{T|s}}) / {{L|H}} = {{I0|A}} + {{V*T/L|A}} = {{I0 + V*T/L|A}}."
        },
