          "unit": "V",
          "explanation": "$di/dt$ = ({{I2|A}} − {{I1|A}}) / {{T|s}} = {{(I2-I1)/T||3}} A/s, so $v = L\\,di/dt$ = {{L|H}} × ({{(I2-I1)/T||3}} A/s) = {{L*(I2-I1)/T|V}}. Negative: the inductor is releasing energy and acts like a source."
        },
